WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.179 --> 00:00:13.000
They say when a YouTuber is dying, the videos
flash before their eyes.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:26.010
Like the psychological horrors of Live Alone.

00:00:26.010 --> 00:00:32.680
Or the haunting isolation of Microhorror:
The End.

00:00:32.680 --> 00:00:36.120
Remember that time I interviewed Marina Joyce?

00:00:36.120 --> 00:00:37.440
"Marina?

00:00:37.440 --> 00:00:38.769
Marina!

00:00:38.769 --> 00:00:40.510
What's happening?

00:00:40.510 --> 00:00:42.050
Marina!"

00:00:42.050 --> 00:00:46.430
Everybody loved Al Dente Creepypasta.

00:00:46.430 --> 00:00:48.570
"...holograms looked shockingly realistic."

00:00:48.570 --> 00:00:50.489
And True Fear.

00:00:50.489 --> 00:00:52.930
"Last time on True Fear..."

00:00:52.930 --> 00:00:55.250
I want to talk about more trailers with you.

00:00:55.250 --> 00:00:59.100
"...Pennywise's reflection right here, you'll
notice that IT's eyes don't seem to reflect

00:00:59.100 --> 00:01:00.100
in the water."

00:01:00.100 --> 00:01:02.340
I want to do more :15 second horrors.

00:01:02.340 --> 00:01:03.930
More Deadstreams.

00:01:03.930 --> 00:01:08.780
I'M NOT SATISFIED WITH STOPPING NOW.

00:01:08.780 --> 00:01:09.930
So many ideas.

00:01:09.930 --> 00:01:14.030
I must find a way to create more.

00:01:14.030 --> 00:01:16.060
Assuming we both survive.

